{"id":2257,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>5月23日上午，中北大学2026年教职工运动会火热开赛。赛场上氛围热烈昂扬，环境与安全工程学院教工代表队精神抖擞、意气风发。</p><p>参赛老师们秉持团结拼搏的信念，全身心投入各项赛事。大家彼此协作、奋勇争先，每一次冲刺、每一轮配合都尽显风采。队员们不惧挑战、凝心聚力，充分展现出教职工强健的体魄与积极进取的精神面貌。</p><p>经过激烈角逐，我院代表队凭借稳定发挥斩获团体第三名的优异成绩。此次赛事不仅增进了同事间情谊，也凝聚了团队向心力，尽显学院奋发向上的良好风尚。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NoR6TknRN4M7M7otz9YL4UaUmWfUz7jbMz7bLzrfMzGDnRv0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hRoSyZL1hVMmQRnz9YnN-aM7CboR-sUzAVUNl4M4NinmWFoRfkUzVVnm6FoR-YU8UJqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLz-PM1bw62w8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11216&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BC982E66CE82FB04F9827A8EBE3795F2/80BA1EF7/822CD\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 417px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NM7WT7nzV2LzN8otR78UzUYL4CZLm-jYozf2Um9DMl-YozG0gihFp2hmCIa0nShfMYhVMYhkU4Gsoz9bUzNDM4AkMRvsnzUaMNnRLR9aM46FMNLbL8r7L4VFL4UDMNr7gtXaQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7YLzCJqdwnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11216&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NUmAT7nNlZL4NiMtNnVozMkMmlZMN-jDnm7snmTRM7Q7o7L0gihFp2hmCIa0nkh2oSh2nkhVUNUaoR7PMRCYLz9ZMlVRLzfRMlMVUzvZL7MFL46RM8-PoRnFozGPU87Jqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLz-PM1bw62w8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11216&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DF9FDEBD08114621885AC10C5CEA780C/37C7B184/901CA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 233px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Nol7T8LRlbMzfkLtRLZnzvsM4AVL8UjiL8CaLN-ZL7Q2nNC0gihFp2hmCIa0LYhVUSyZM1h2MmlZLlQ7oR6kU4LYMmvPLRVfn7V7nmT7UznFnRWRMR98olQFM7rVUznkgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7YLzCJqdwnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11216&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NLR7TaMRQ7n7UDntNLsUN7iU49PnzGj4nmGDLRU4nzC8oRN0gihFp2hmCIa0UYy8MkyZLYhVLmA2nll4U8liL467Ml7anmGaoR9DL7n2olMFU8-iMRA7LRfFM4vsol7Jqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLz-PM1bw62w8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11216&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C4483E28FEE3CE537D5A0F008860DF9C/CB548D00/7779A\" vheight=\" 294.007px\" vwidth=\" 392px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NLRQTkUmNaozC8ot77sLRG4M